Notebook[{
Cell["\<\
Caminata cu\[AAcute]ntica 1D con paredes reflectantes: espectro exacto\
\>", "Title",ExpressionUUID->"a6968fed-4621-4cb6-b94d-a11570cd3b49"],

Cell["\<\
n sitios j = 0,\[Ellipsis],n\[Minus]1, moneda C \[Element] U(2) \
homog\[EAcute]nea. Base posici\[OAcute]n \[CircleTimes] moneda, \
\[IAcute]ndice = 2j + s, orden de la moneda {R, L} = {j+1, j\[Minus]1}. En \
las paredes: S|n\[Minus]1,R\:27e9 = |n\[Minus]1,L\:27e9, S|0,L\:27e9 = |0,R\
\:27e9 (se queda y se invierte, como en QWMisc). U = S\[CenterDot](\|01d7d9\
\:2099 \[CircleTimes] C).\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"a0eefde3-545f-4cea-a335-d0f961759d26"],

Cell["\<\
F\[OAcute]rmulas de qw_reflectante.tex. C = e^{i\[Alpha]}(a b; \[Minus]b* \
a*). Banda: \[Lambda] = e^{i\[Alpha]} e^{\[PlusMinus]i\[Omega]_m}, cos \
\[Omega]_m = |a| cos(\[Pi]m/n), m = 1,\[Ellipsis],n\[Minus]1. Aislados \
(estados de borde): \[Lambda] = e^{i\[Alpha]}(\[PlusMinus]\[Sqrt](1 \[Minus] \
(Im b)\.b2) + i Im b). Total 2(n\[Minus]1) + 2 = 2n.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"fe6c9784-ecd4-4f92-a697-2768e4833529"],

Cell["Definiciones", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"d4800073-2908-49af-919a-8199e534844b"],

Cell["\<\
(* Shift con rebote; estados {j, s}, s = 1 (R), 2 (L) *)
idx[j_, s_] := 2 j + s;
shiftPared[n_] := SparseArray[Join[
   Table[{idx[If[j < n - 1, j + 1, j], If[j < n - 1, 1, 2]], idx[j, 1]} -> 1, \
{j, 0, n - 1}],
   Table[{idx[If[j > 0, j - 1, j], If[j > 0, 2, 1]], idx[j, 2]} -> 1, {j, 0, \
n - 1}]], {2 n, 2 n}];
uPared[n_, c_] := shiftPared[n] . KroneckerProduct[IdentityMatrix[n], c];

(* Moneda: C = e^{i al}(a, b; -conj(b), conj(a)), a = |a| e^{i pa}, b = \
sqrt(1-|a|^2) e^{i pb} *)
moneda[al_, aa_, pa_, pb_] := Module[{a = aa Exp[I pa], b = Sqrt[1 - aa^2] \
Exp[I pb]},
   Exp[I al] {{a, b}, {-Conjugate[b], Conjugate[a]}}];
(* {al, |a|, pa, pb} de una moneda dada *)
params[c_] := Module[{al = Arg[Det[c]]/2, a, b},
   a = c[[1, 1]] Exp[-I al]; b = c[[1, 2]] Exp[-I al];
   {al, Abs[a], Arg[a], Arg[b]}];
monedaCUE[] := RandomVariate[CircularUnitaryMatrixDistribution[2]];

(* Espectro exacto *)
eigBanda[n_, {al_, aa_, _, _}] := Flatten[Table[Exp[I al] Exp[s I ArcCos[aa \
Cos[Pi m/n]]], {m, 1, n - 1}, {s, {1, -1}}]];
eigAislados[n_, {al_, aa_, pa_, pb_}] := Module[{imb = Sqrt[1 - aa^2] Sin[pb]},
   Exp[I al] {Sqrt[1 - imb^2] + I imb, -Sqrt[1 - imb^2] + I imb}];
eigAnalitico[n_, p_] := Join[eigBanda[n, p], eigAislados[n, p]];
eigNumerico[n_, c_] := Eigenvalues[N[Normal[uPared[n, c]]]];
dist[x_, y_] := Max[Min[Abs[# - y]] & /@ x];\
\>", "Input",ExpressionUUID->"5ba9ece6-c32c-49b6-aff1-92b0fac6bb1d"],

Cell["Verificaci\[OAcute]n: num\[EAcute]rico vs anal\[IAcute]tico", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"98f844bd-c2b5-47df-80c6-5aff20d364f4"],

Cell["\<\
(* error m\[AAcute]ximo para varias n y monedas CUE(2) *)
Table[Module[{c = monedaCUE[], num, ana},
   num = eigNumerico[n, c]; ana = eigAnalitico[n, params[c]];
   {n, Max[dist[num, ana], dist[ana, num]]}], {n, {2, 3, 5, 8, 13, 40}}] // \
TableForm\
\>", "Input",ExpressionUUID->"f5ee5023-e1e6-436b-83fe-966b6e5fa851"],

Cell["Espectro y estados de borde: jugar con la moneda", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"47ebc5e0-2d24-48b4-9a3f-87fb2a1882da"],

Cell["\<\
Izquierda: c\[IAcute]rculo unitario. Puntos azules = banda, rombos naranjas = \
aislados, c\[IAcute]rculos rojos = diagonalizaci\[OAcute]n num\[EAcute]rica. \
Arco gris = banda para n \[RightArrow] \[Infinity]. Derecha: |\[Psi]_j|\.b2 \
(sumado sobre la moneda) del eigenvector num\[EAcute]rico m\[AAcute]s cercano \
al aislado elegido. Si Re b = 0 (p_b = \[PlusMinus]\[Pi]/2) los estados \
aislados dejan de estar localizados. \[CurlyPhi]_a no cambia nada; p_b solo \
entra v\[IAcute]a Im b.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"65aea850-f2aa-46ae-88c1-0bc0ac3ed918"],

Cell["\<\
Manipulate[
 Module[{c = moneda[al, aa, pa, pb], p = {al, aa, pa, pb}, es, num, vecs, \
ais, k, psi, w0 = ArcCos[aa]},
  {num, vecs} = Eigensystem[N[Normal[uPared[n, c]]]];
  ais = eigAislados[n, p][[cual]];
  k = First[Ordering[Abs[num - ais], 1]];
  psi = Total[Partition[Abs[vecs[[k]]]^2, 2], {2}];
  Row[{
    Graphics[{LightGray, Circle[],
      {Gray, Thickness[0.012], Circle[{0, 0}, 1, {al + w0, al + Pi - w0}], \
Circle[{0, 0}, 1, {al - Pi + w0, al - w0}]},
      Blue, PointSize[0.018], Point[ReIm /@ eigBanda[n, p]],
      Orange, EdgeForm[Black], Polygon[# + 0.05 {{1, 0}, {0, 1}, {-1, 0}, {0, \
-1}}] & /@ (ReIm /@ eigAislados[n, p]),
      Red, Circle[#, 0.045] & /@ (ReIm /@ num)},
     Axes -> True, PlotRange -> 1.15, ImageSize -> 320],
    ListPlot[psi, Joined -> True, Mesh -> All, PlotRange -> {0, All}, Frame \
-> True,
     FrameLabel -> {\"j\", \"|\[Psi]_j|\.b2\"}, PlotLabel -> Row[{\"\[Lambda] \
= \", NumberForm[num[[k]], 3]}], ImageSize -> 380]}]],
 {{n, 20}, 2, 120, 1, Appearance -> \"Labeled\"},
 {{al, 0., \"\[Alpha]\"}, -Pi, Pi, Appearance -> \"Labeled\"},
 {{aa, 0.7, \"|a|\"}, 0.01, 0.99, Appearance -> \"Labeled\"},
 {{pa, 0., \"\[CurlyPhi]_a\"}, -Pi, Pi, Appearance -> \"Labeled\"},
 {{pb, 0.5, \"p_b\"}, -Pi, Pi, Appearance -> \"Labeled\"},
 {{cual, 1, \"aislado\"}, {1 -> \"+\", 2 -> \"\[Minus]\"}},
 Button[\"moneda CUE(2) aleatoria\", {al, aa, pa, pb} = params[monedaCUE[]]],
 TrackedSymbols :> {n, al, aa, pa, pb, cual}]\
\>", "Input",ExpressionUUID->"33eb660f-d709-4883-a286-51c43f6054a8"],

Cell["Comparaci\[OAcute]n con el anillo", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"6fbb3ae9-3983-4cca-a1b7-044309d3c599"],

Cell["\<\
Desplegado, el shift con rebote es un ciclo de 2n estados. Por eso la banda \
usa q = \[Pi]m/n (la malla de un anillo de 2n sitios) y no 2\[Pi]m/n. Para b \
= 0 el espectro es exactamente e^{i\[Alpha]} e^{i\[Pi]m/n}, m = \
0,\[Ellipsis],2n\[Minus]1.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"63464b1c-b4ab-4b1b-9a08-88db990539f7"],

Cell["\<\
With[{n = 6}, Sort[Arg[eigNumerico[n, moneda[0, 1, 0, 0]]]] / (Pi/n)] // Chop\
\
\>", "Input",ExpressionUUID->"6aadb4ca-4f99-42e0-8100-c825149cb536"],

Cell["Espaciamientos sin unfolding", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"df6d9064-172f-415f-b1cb-cb5333bd3234"],

Cell["\<\
Niveles de banda en el dominio fundamental (m \[LessEqual] n/2; las simetr\
\[IAcute]as antiunitarias emparejan el resto). Espaciamientos \[Omega]_{m+1} \
\[Minus] \[Omega]_m en unidades de \[Pi]/n, D \[TildeTilde] n/2 niveles, sin \
unfolding. Curva roja: P(s) = (2/\[Pi])(|b|/|a|)/((1 \[Minus] s\.b2)\[Sqrt](1 \
\[Minus] s\.b2/|a|\.b2)), 0 \[LessEqual] s < |a|, de las notas. Con unfolding \
exacto todo colapsa a P(s) = \[Delta](s \[Minus] 1) (picket fence).\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"06e0b811-c16a-4095-8015-ea3fbcf06bfa"],

Cell["\<\
Manipulate[
 Module[{w = Table[ArcCos[aa Cos[Pi m/n]], {m, 1, Floor[n/2]}], s},
  s = Differences[w]/(Pi/n);
  Show[Histogram[s, {0, aa, aa/40}, \"PDF\"],
   Plot[(2/Pi) (Sqrt[1 - aa^2]/aa)/((1 - x^2) Sqrt[1 - x^2/aa^2]), {x, 0, \
aa}, PlotStyle -> Red],
   Frame -> True, FrameLabel -> {\"s (unidades de \[Pi]/n)\", \"P(s)\"}, \
PlotRange -> {{0, 1}, All}, ImageSize -> 420]],
 {{n, 2000}, 20, 20000, 1, Appearance -> \"Labeled\"},
 {{aa, 0.7, \"|a|\"}, 0.05, 0.99, Appearance -> \"Labeled\"}]\
\>", "Input",ExpressionUUID->"4e93edba-f023-45db-9986-b97a4867cddb"]
},
